![Chilean Birds](cover.png)

This is an small API using the Chilean Birds Dataset. Created using
ProcessWire, React and Docker. You can search for the chilean birds
and get useful information about them.

```github
NinjasCL/chileanbirds-dataset | Dataset con las aves de Chile
```

## Backend Stack

- Docker
- ProcessWire
- MariaDB
- PHP 7.4

![Screenshot](screenshot.png)

## Frontend Stack

- React.js
- Bulma.css

## Demo

You can access the demo site here:

<https://aves.ninjas.cl/>

And the demo api here:

<https://aves.ninjas.cl/api/birds>

```github
joyofpw/chileanbirds-api | API para consultar las aves de Chile
```

